<title>USA: Kmart offers new credit card throughout U.S.</title>
<headline>Kmart offers new credit card throughout U.S.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kmart Corp said Tuesday that it was offering a new private-label credit card throughout the United States.</p>
<p>The card, introduced on Monday, features rebates of up to a six percent on eligible purchases, the retailer said.</p>
<p>The Kmart credit card, offered through Beneficial National Bank USA, a unit of Beneficial Corp, and various incentive programs were tested in 11 markets throughout the United States earlier this year.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
